1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Car runs hot at red lights

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,000
but fine on the highway?
Here's why.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Moving, air pushes through
the radiator on its own.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Stopped, only the fan
can cool it.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,500
If that fan isn't spinning
once the engine's warm,

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,000
that's one clue the fan motor,
relay, or coolant sensor may need a look.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,500
Low coolant or a stuck thermostat
can cause the same symptom —

8
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,000
do not guess which one.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Gauge creeping up at idle?
Stop by and we'll take a look.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
SAVE THIS for the next time
you're idling hot
